{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1495097-tc-assassins-inspiration-media-for-societies","id":1495097,"title":"[TC Assassins] Inspiration media for Societies","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-10-16T20:20:21-07:00","id":1495097,"title":"[TC Assassins] Inspiration media for Societies","content":"<i><b>What media inspirations would you point for the Signal Society?</b></i><br /> <br /> Beside <b>Secret World's</b> <i><b>'Broadcast'</b></i> questline - with doing Contracts instead of zombie hunting in <b>SW</b>. \ud83d\ude0e ( Starts at 14:00 of this video. ) <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=87-ZhhIjgx4\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=87-ZhhIjgx4</a><br /> <br /> <b>John Wick</b> movie series is clearly main inspiration for <b><i>Krugu Vorov.</i></b><br /> <br /> <b>Assassin's Creed</b> franchise is main inspiration behind <i><b>Daughters of Jacobins</b></i> ( sorta modern Assassins Brotherhood) and <i><b>Society of Leonidas</b></i> ( Templars in <b>AC</b> games).<br /> <br /> <b><i>Swarm</i></b> also could not pin pointed main inspiration in my mind - but for weird reasons I think can work <b>Squid Game</b> here as sorta look on capitalistic rat race? \ud83e\udd14 Or some Silicon Valley 'do this or die' attitude, but put on the art of killing people... \ud83e\udd14","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-22-2022, 12:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-17T00:53:44-07:00","id":1495100,"title":"","content":"For the Signal? To a certain degree, <b>The Equalizer</b> films with Denzel Washington.<br /> <br /> And not for any specific society, but also <b>The Destroyer</b> novels (and the Remo Williams film based on them), the anime <b>Lycoris Recoil</b>, the manga <b>Spy X Family </b>(the anime hasn't caught up with the arc fleshing out the assassin side of things yet), and the manga/anime <b>Crying Freeman</b>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-17T23:10:40-07:00","id":1495152,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1495097-tc-assassins-inspiration-media-for-societies?p=1495100#post1495100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And not for any specific society, but also <b>The Destroyer</b> novels (and the Remo Williams film based on them), the anime <b>Lycoris Recoil</b>, the manga <b>Spy X Family </b>(the anime hasn't caught up with the arc fleshing out the assassin side of things yet), and the manga/anime <b>Crying Freeman</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>On a similar note, the manga <b>Sakamoto Days</b> and <b>Marriagetoxin</b> [sic].<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-22T10:37:32-07:00","id":1495440,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1495097-tc-assassins-inspiration-media-for-societies?p=1495100#post1495100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For the Signal? To a certain degree, <b>The Equalizer</b> films with Denzel Washington.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12890_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12890\" data-vbnamecard=\"12890\">No One of Consequence</a> - I just did watched <b>The Equalizer 1</b> - Beside taking place in lower class circles, I do not see a much relation to <b>Signal</b>. Plus Denzel fight against <b>Krugu Vorov </b>assassin with his Russian mafia support in this move. ( Still not proper <b>Signal</b>. ) Maybe I miss something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-22-2022, 04:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-22T11:01:02-07:00","id":1495443,"title":"","content":"The Equalizer was originally an 80s tv series, in which a former intelligence operative living in New York City would help people in trouble, often against the mob, corrupt cops, or others &quot;above the law&quot;. He did this more or less pro bono and would advertise his services in the newspaper want ads. The films update the concept and make it much more blatant that he used to be a highly skilled assassin. The first film is essentially an origin story, ending at the status quo of the tv series, with him posting his ad on the internet. <div align=\"center\"><br /> Got a Problem?<br /> Odds Against You?<br /> Call The Equalizer<br /> 212 555 4200<br /> <br /> <br /> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":12890,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","user":"No One of Consequence","date":". 10-22-2022, 02:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-22T11:10:41-07:00","id":1495444,"title":"","content":"As far as The Swarm goes, you can probably find some inspirational ideas in the graphic novel <b>The Strange Talent of Luther Strode</b>, especially if you feel like doing an Assassins/Aberant crossover.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-30T12:22:27-07:00","id":1495894,"title":"","content":"Why <b>Wanted</b> (2008) is PERFECT inspiration for <b>Assassins</b> ( and <b>TC Core</b> ) \ud83d\ude02 Also, as maybe <b><i>Daughters of Jacobins</i></b> inspiration, on prophecy part of Society? <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hK8D7tsbI_g&amp;fbclid=IwAR1CT0XlMKQTZx6-9qrK_TOi8EzJqU16cM0QInG4yODO5rDevpfa-JeQ1ZU\" target=\"_blank\"> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hK8D7tsbI_g\" data-code=\"hK8D7tsbI_g\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/hK8D7tsbI_g/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></a>","signature":