"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-26T22:53:23-08:00","id":1503980,"title":"","content":"Not for any group in particular, but two 90s films that are worth watching, 1994's <b>Leon: The Professional</b> (and its spiritual sequel 2011's <i>Columbiana</i>) and 1999's <b>Ghost Dog: Way of the Samurai</b>.<br /> <br /> Also, if you have never seen John Woo's 1989 film <b>The Killer</b>, you really should.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":12890,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","user":"No One of Consequence","date":". 02-27-2023, 01:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-09T10:09:10-08:00","id":1504951,"title":"","content":"I watch <b><i>Phantom: Requiem for the Phantom</i> </b>and it's VERY <b>Assassins</b> -like anime series. They even call future killers The Talents - and later Assassins. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I just wonder if series <b><i>Inferno</i></b> organisation would reflect any existing in Assassins Society? \ud83e\udd14<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r21ekYTeTQU\" data-code=\"r21ekYTeTQU\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/r21ekYTeTQU/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-15T18:29:47-07:00","id":1505464,"title":"","content":"The 1996 film <b>The Long Kiss Goodnight</b> is another one worth watching, especially if you are looking for ideas about assassins who have lost their memory or, alternatively, are buried so deep in a cover identity that they no longer remember who they really are/were.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-30T02:46:46-07:00","id":1513274,"title":"","content":"The recent Korean film <b>Kill Baksoon</b>, available on Netflix in the US, has a fairly interesting set up for professional assassin organizations having to work under rules. The main group (MK Ent.) has a really nice HQ that is a mix of Art Deco gothic and modern corporate, and a whole training program with interns that I want to borrow for one group or another.<br /> <br /> And on the sillier side, a Japanese film from a couple of years ago called <b>Baby Assassins</b>, about two teenage girl contract killers whose organization requires them to live together as roommates and get part time regular jobs, apparently to help them pass for normal and to protect the organization from the tax investigators. There is a sequel coming out this year.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}